# M6 mode 3 (own games) with four players: two virtual controllers and
# both keyboard halves; P3 picks extra slot 9 (index 8) on the join
# screen; a controller unplugged mid-level and a new one taking the seat.
size 854x480
# The first launch plays the intro: hold a key to skip it.
wait 150
hold enter 70
idle 400
solve
idle 900
key escape
key down 3
key enter
idle
key down 4
key enter
pads 2
pad 1 a
pad 2 a
key e
key enter
pad 1 up 5
pad 1 right
pad 1 right
expect state join OwnGames players=4
# P3 (left half): Ready → up 4 → Save, then left until slot index 8.
key w 4
key a 4
shot 01-join-own-4
pad 1 a
pad 2 a
key e
key enter
wait 50
expect state multi OwnGames players=4 views=4
expect state v2 p3 slot8 baba/0level
idle
p3 moves RRRR
p4 moves RR
unplug 2
expect log unplugged p2
shot 02-own-4-unplugged
pads 1
pad 3 a
expect log rejoin p2
p2 solve
p2 idle 900
expect save 1 baba 0level 3
p3 moves RRRR
p3 idle 900
expect save 8 baba 0level 3
expect same p2 p3
shot 03-own-4
p1 press pause
p1 press down 3
p1 press wait
idle
expect state title
quit
